   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"6\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>A sequence of numbers is given by <span data-math=\"a_2=1\">a_2=1</span>, <span data-math=\"a_3=5\">a_3=5</span>, <span data-math=\"a_4=9\">a_4=9</span>, <span data-math=\"a_5=13\">a_5=13</span>, <span data-math=\"a_6=17\">a_6=17</span>. Which expression can be used to find the <span data-math=\"n^{th}\">n^{th}</span> term of the sequence?</li>\n</ol>",
